{
  "format": "story-pages-v1",
  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-big-red-truck-v3-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "7fc06eb2acd7493066c9817f79669baf8254af3cd6c3152e28afded3584e0150",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1e1c8fd777fb31e8bafcbdfa19f6617d2eb83e09c3c4b812a87f19cf1e610855",
      "text": "悟空和\n大红消防车",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c43ba8b00e9b5ea59a2f1a7a7dde1cf59bc27d41bf4b24230674a8337e168960",
      "text": "一辆大红车开过来。\n“看那些轮子！”\n悟空的尾巴“嘣”地翘起来！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "5ace8db5a0d08027ef108682f850d54ca92f3d80280baed61f8d12c377981e49",
      "text": "在消防站，本叔叔挥挥手。\n“快来看看吧！”\n悟空有好多问题想问。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "3661d9c8c1cef9f4b549dc5ea93538fd14c574b6f3cc13f15bc372aa349cdb22",
      "text": "“为什么穿大靴子？”\n“大靴子能保护我的脚。”\n悟空看看自己的鞋：\n“我的只会吱吱响！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "b6d22ba73904f236a95ebd3d5cca114ec6b7215729e6090bacb3b707458a6612",
      "text": "本叔叔借他一顶玩具头盔。\n头盔滑下来，盖住了眉毛。\n“消防员需要眼睛吗？”\n“非常需要！”本叔叔笑了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ea8802b4bf38e72067f66ecf04ce6420d859437f9f740c2712229943b3196453",
      "text": "本叔叔拿出一个特别的面罩。\n“它帮我呼吸\n干净的空气。”\n声音一下子变了样！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "56dbd0582381290c15b46340b3674b3ed0340d8c4ab118f598e3136e0b7d4eb4",
      "text": "“还是我呀！”本叔叔说。\n悟空也挥挥手：\n“咦，本叔叔！\n你的声音变啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "76026e8589bdca8edb29f09afd96df0475387ef666fb758e9aff5809150ded8f",
      "text": "“那是一根大面条吗？”\n“是水带！”本叔叔说，\n“用来把水送过去。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "82cf2e02b14597a19b4990e606caf849d62f4fe0a69377e8b16ca6c412a5c390",
      "text": "本叔叔握住水带。\n哗——水喷了出来。\n一颗小水珠亲了亲\n悟空的鼻子。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "10b40e8a00bd30a5cf89b63842ed84cacf63dac3d62d0d00f64b5a2d5f23cf84",
      "text": "“那梯子呢？”\n“它帮我们爬到高处。”\n悟空站在下面，\n尾巴往上伸。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1482288c72553c0c7ff6ea5a6c0d7e3718b2464b92791580ae8d2cc755002efa",
      "text": "接着，本叔叔拿出报警器。\n“嘀！嘀！嘀！”\n“这是警报声，在提醒大家。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "baa9f5f7a6819813d6e06ea8d58407ce72d115f639a294b8dd8c93e025ff3149",
      "text": "“听到警报，就到外面去。”\n他们练习怎么走出去。\n“到了外面，就待在那里。”\n本叔叔说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4ccae131e86941b22a59106f5a985f5c921543bf6b9286c7f8f8833744daeaa9",
      "text": "他们约好在一棵树下集合。\n“数数鼻子！”悟空说。\n八戒把自己数了两遍。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a37cf6dea48232b1597b8a96ae21e2db1356ffefc39f0e98b474820acf97d63b",
      "text": "悟空谢谢本叔叔：\n“好大的消防车，\n好多重要的事，\n还有一颗热心肠！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "688ab2b9df57e679294d3d45633f563ecd7a92cd51d34bf28a843ddd78d40597",
      "text": "回到家，玩具车响起来：\n呜哇……呜哇……\n声音小了，\n又小了……嘘。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0d203971f2094db2be801b4bc1d0a2801608b8b7f01ed8801cb9caaf6b911385",
      "text": "他给玩具车盖好被子。\n“晚安，小帮手们。”\n房间安静下来了，\n悟空也安静下来了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "289f1ec520e4ee3afd619415c1cb27295d9ced81c1cf804b8ba097d89c275be2",
